/Title (A belt/pulley support assembly of this type is commonly used in belt-drive power transmission systems, conveyor systems, and general industrial machinery, where it supports a rotating shaft or pulley and transfers load safely to a mounting structure. Understanding the design and documentation of such an assembly is directly applicable to real-world mechanical design roles involving power transmission components, material handling systems, and machine design.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 990 0 R
>>
